  title: Awadh
  text: Saadat Khan Burhan-ul-Mulk founded the autonomous state of Awadh in 1722. Its nawabs, ruling from Faizabad and later Lucknow, patronised music, poetry and cuisine. The British annexed Awadh in 1856.
